I am unhappy because of trust, after all, it is a face-wiping product, you should purchase it in a physical store, it is acknowledged that it is more costly.
Because it is a surge, I did not read the comments, I've submitted it to the State Administration for Industry and Commerce's e-commerce platform, let us all work together to protect our rights.
